description = "A libretro core for the EPOCH Super Cassette Vision, the 1984 Japanese console also sold in France in 1984 as the YENO Super Cassette Vision. A system BIOS is required. Cartridges are dumped as a single file or as numbered parts, and the core converts them to its own .cart format, which records the bank layout that a raw dump cannot carry."
notes = "(!) upd7801g.s01 (md5): 635a978fd40db9a18ee44eff449fc126|A cartridge dumped in several parts loads from its .0 file, with .1, .2 and .3 beside it.|A .cart file appearing in the save directory after a launch is normal: it is the converted cartridge."
